# interplay_dag_long_chain_16: One chain of 51 nodes over the root and all sixteen children, three times round (0, 1, ..., 16), each waiting on the one before, written in order and rung last FIFO first: the order is total, so the 51 interrupts and the stamp slots each one saw are locked in order, the counter reads 51 and logged its first fifteen steps. Phase 1 runs the same chain round again, from child 16 down to the root, over three tasks, with its first node held on the gate: sixteen FIFOs wait on the one before, the root on child 1.
